\description{
\if{html}{\figure{logo.svg}{options: style='float: right' alt='logo' width='120'}}

A convention stack for submission-style clinical reporting: pure builder functions turn analysis data into tables, listings and figures; a convention engine applies page geometry, fonts and title blocks when rendering to Rich Text Format (RTF) through 'r2rtf'; a title resolver reads titles and footnotes from a table-of-contents source with live, snapshot and fallback modes; and figure rendering can run in an isolated child process with bounded retries. The same builders serve scheduled batch programs and interactive previews.
